  "title": "Tizeti appoints Oluwadamilola Ojomo as Vice President for Financial Risk, Compliance, and Audit",
  "summary": "Tizeti, West Africa pioneer solar-based internet service provider, has announced the appointment of Oluwadamilola Ojomo as Vice President, Financial Risk, Compliance, and Audit. “We are excited to welcome Oluwadamilola Ojomo to Tizeti,” said Kendall Ananyi, Founder and Chief Executive Officer at Tizeti. “Her extensive expertise in financial risk management and compliance will be invaluable as we continue to scale our […]",
